WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.504 --> 00:00:13.080
Hello! Welcome to Cosmogeek Solutions. Today we will walk you through our Web Development service, from start to finish.

2
00:00:13.368 --> 00:00:25.104
Today, your website is often a customer's first meeting with your business. When that first impression is good, trust follows naturally.

3
00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:36.600
That is why we build websites and web applications that are fast, look great on every screen and turn visitors into customers.

4
00:00:37.296 --> 00:00:44.688
First, let us look at the problems most businesses face with their website.

5
00:00:44.976 --> 00:00:55.800
Problem one is a slow, outdated website. If a page takes too long to load, visitors leave before reading anything.

6
00:00:56.088 --> 00:01:04.656
Problem two is a layout that breaks on mobile. Most people browse on their phones today.

7
00:01:04.944 --> 00:01:13.296
Three, unstructured code, which makes every new feature both expensive and risky.

8
00:01:13.584 --> 00:01:22.056
And four, a weak SEO structure, so your business barely shows up on Google search.

9
00:01:22.752 --> 00:01:31.488
Now let us talk about the solution. Our Web Development service includes all of these capabilities.

10
00:01:31.776 --> 00:01:42.864
Responsive design. Your website adjusts correctly to phones, tablets, laptops and large screens.

11
00:01:43.152 --> 00:01:49.944
Business websites and landing pages with a clear message and a strong call to action.

12
00:01:50.232 --> 00:01:58.944
Web applications and portals, such as customer portals, admin panels and dashboards, with secure login.

13
00:01:59.232 --> 00:02:06.240
E-commerce: product catalogues, shopping carts and payment gateway integration.

14
00:02:06.528 --> 00:02:14.664
Performance and SEO: Core Web Vitals tuning, technical SEO and accessibility checks.

15
00:02:14.952 --> 00:02:22.128
And after launch, we also take care of hosting, SSL, backups and maintenance.

16
00:02:22.824 --> 00:02:34.512
Let us look at an example. This is a typical business website: clean navigation at the top, followed by a strong hero section.

17
00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:44.328
Below are the service cards, with inquiry and WhatsApp buttons wherever they matter, so visitors can get in touch immediately.

18
00:02:44.616 --> 00:02:54.072
And the same design automatically becomes a single column on mobile. No zooming, and no broken layout.

19
00:02:54.768 --> 00:03:00.312
Now let us understand our development process, step by step.

20
00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:10.368
Step one, Discovery. We understand your goals and audience, and prepare the sitemap and wireframes.

21
00:03:10.656 --> 00:03:19.656
Step two, UI Design: designs for desktop and mobile that match your brand.

22
00:03:19.944 --> 00:03:32.352
Step three, Development: a staging website with reusable components, APIs, forms and integrations that you can review yourself.

23
00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:41.472
Step four, Testing: complete checks across browsers, screen sizes and internet speeds.

24
00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:52.104
And step five, Launch: domain, SSL, hosting and analytics setup, followed by post-launch support.

25
00:03:52.800 --> 00:04:06.576
On the technology side, we use modern tools such as React.js, Next.js, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3 and Node.js.

26
00:04:06.864 --> 00:04:14.784
These technologies deliver fast performance and make it easy to add new features later.

27
00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:19.584
So, how does your business benefit?

28
00:04:19.872 --> 00:04:27.960
First, a strong first impression. A professional design builds trust with new visitors.

29
00:04:28.248 --> 00:04:36.048
Second, more inquiries, with contact forms and WhatsApp links exactly where they belong.

30
00:04:36.336 --> 00:04:45.552
Third, visibility in search. Fast loading and the right structure help Google understand your pages better.

31
00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:54.648
And fourth, ready for growth. Modular code means new pages and features can be added quickly.

32
00:04:55.344 --> 00:05:08.352
Who is this service for? Company websites, lead-generation landing pages, customer and dealer portals, online stores, and booking or registration systems.

33
00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:21.144
Retail, real estate, energy, education, healthcare and professional services: we design each solution around that industry's needs.

34
00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:33.648
So if you want a new website or web application, or want to upgrade your existing website, talk to Cosmogeek Solutions.

35
00:05:33.936 --> 00:05:43.080
Our team works from Wardha, Maharashtra, and has been helping businesses go digital since 2019.

36
00:05:43.368 --> 00:05:51.816
Click the Start a Project button below, or call or WhatsApp us. Thank you!
